#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grain for the North"
msgstr "北の国に麦を"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters send news: the summer in the north was cold, and their families have no grain. My ship "
"leaves in three days: fill it with twelve crates!"
msgstr "かりうどたちから知らせがきた。北の夏はさむくて、家族の麦がないそうだ。わしの船は3日後に出る。麦を12箱つんでくれ!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve crates! Nobody in the north goes hungry this winter. The whole valley thanks you."
msgstr "12箱!この冬、北ではだれもおなかをすかせない。谷じゅうのみんなが、{crew|きみ|きみ|きみたち}にありがとうと言っているぞ。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the harvest failed, the farms helped each other: next year, it might be them."
msgstr "とり入れがだめな年は、農場どうしでたすけ合ったよ。つぎの年は、自分たちがこまるかもしれないからね。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Wool Fair"
msgstr "羊毛の市"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The wool fair! Traders come from the Long Lake to buy. Bring me eight crates of wool, the more the"
" better, and the fair is a success."
msgstr "羊毛の市よ!長い湖から商人が買いにくるの。羊毛を8箱もってきて。多ければ多いほどいいわ。そうすれば市は大せいこう!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eight crates! The traders from the Long Lake ask: who are these girls? I say: the best traders of "
"the Home Lakes."
msgstr "8箱!長い湖の商人たちが「{crew|この子|この子|この子たち}はだれ?」って聞くの。わたしは「ふるさとの湖でいちばんの商人よ」ってこたえるわ。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool was so important that some sagas tell of whole ships full of it."
msgstr "羊毛はとても大切で、羊毛をいっぱいつんだ船の話がサガにあるくらいだよ。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Goats on the Island"
msgstr "島のヤギ"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My four goats swam to Bergö! They eat Dagny's flowers, and she is cross. Bring them back before "
"they eat her kiln too!"
msgstr "うちのヤギ4頭が、ベリエーまでおよいでいっちゃった!ダグニーの花を食べて、ダグニーはおこってるの。かままで食べちゃう前につれもどして!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My naughty goats! Tomorrow I build a higher fence. Here, my best cheese."
msgstr "いたずらヤギたち!明日もっと高いさくを作るわ。はい、いちばんいいチーズよ。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take them, take them! They ate my flowers and a basket and a shoe!"
msgstr "つれてって、つれてって!わたしの花と、かごと、くつまで食べたのよ!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats are good swimmers when they must be, and they eat nearly anything."
msgstr "ヤギはいざとなればおよぎがじょうずで、ほとんど何でも食べるよ。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "News for Everybody"
msgstr "みんなにニュース"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Big news: a ship from the Long Lake will come, and the way between the lakes opens! Tell the "
"smith, the fishers of Stormvik and Orm in Hallvik. I tell the rest."
msgstr "大ニュースだ。長い湖から船がきて、湖と湖のあいだの道がひらくぞ!かじやと、ストルムヴィクの魚とりと、ハルヴィクのオルムにつたえてくれ。のこりはわしがつたえる。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A ship from the Long Lake? They will want my iron!"
msgstr "長い湖から船が?わたしの鉄をほしがるだろうな!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New lakes, new fish! Thank you for telling us."
msgstr "新しい湖、新しい魚!知らせてくれてありがとう。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Guests from far away! I must brew more. Thank you, girls!"
msgstr "遠くからのお客さん!もっとエールを作らなきゃ。ありがとう!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The lakes of the north were joined by rivers and portages, where boats were dragged over land."
msgstr "北の湖は川や、船を地面の上で引っぱる道でつながっていたよ。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Cow for Grim"
msgstr "グリムに牛を"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I am old, and I would like fresh milk every morning. Bring me a cow from the horse farm. The swans"
" will be jealous!"
msgstr "わしは年をとった。毎朝しぼりたてのミルクがのみたいんじゃ。馬のぼくじょうから牛を1頭つれてきておくれ。白鳥がやきもちをやくぞ!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A cow! I call her Swan, ha. Here, for your trouble, and for all the years you visited an old man."
msgstr "牛じゃ!名前は「白鳥」にしよう、ハハ。はい、手間をかけたお礼と、年よりのところに何年もきてくれたお礼じゃ。"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good cow gave milk for ten years or more, and was part of the family."
msgstr "よい牛は10年よりも長くミルクを出して、家族のなかまだったよ。"

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flowers on the Hill"
msgstr "おかの花"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plant flowers on the sunny hill! When they bloom, bring three crates to Gudrun's inn: she wants "
"the inn to smell like summer."
msgstr "日なたのおかに花をうえて!花がさいたら、グドルンの宿屋に3箱もっていって。宿屋を夏のにおいにしたいんだって。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flower seeds in the earth. In two days, they bloom."
msgstr "花のたねを土にまいたよ。2日でさくよ。"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Flowers on every table! The guests smile. Here is your silver, and a cup of milk for each of you."
